    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645320/extras/4b2be7f89783766d7b21bc3c71080830.avif?t=1755254086\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span><strong>Succupie: An Erotic Short Story </strong>is a pornographic short-form, first-person tale about depression, pizza, and a horny demonic delivery girl.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Sexy, Supernatural Slice-of-life Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a dejected, reclusive 20-something year old in the mid 90s, who strikes up an unlikely 'situationship' with Marcine, a demonic (and very horny) pizza delivery girl. Taking place over a week, Succupie takes you on a supernatural journey through 90s nostalgia, public access TV, and of course, <strong>spontaneous hardcore sex.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645320/extras/29b6746cc737d4bdbd3cdc787ffe3de1.poster.avif?t=1755254086\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645320/extras/29b6746cc737d4bdbd3cdc787ffe3de1.webm?t=1755254086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645320/extras/29b6746cc737d4bdbd3cdc787ffe3de1.mp4?t=1755254086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet (and Fuck) Marcine: the Pizza Delivery Succubus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the peppy delivery girl Marcine through heartfelt, humorous conversations about modern life, culture, and whether or not pineapple really belongs on pizza. And then get to know her even better by experiencing <strong>fully animated POV sex scenes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\